#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:120
msgid ""
"Community SH es un panel para desplegar y administrar instancias de Odoo y "
"otras aplicaciones sobre Docker. Cada instancia tiene su propia base de "
"datos, dominio, SSL y backups, y todo se gestiona desde el navegador."
msgstr ""
"Community SH is a dashboard to deploy and manage Odoo instances and other "
"apps on Docker. Each instance has its own database, domain, SSL and backups, "
"all managed from the browser."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:132
msgid "Crear cuenta"
msgstr "Create account"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:152
msgid "Apps listas"
msgstr "Ready apps"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:156
msgid "Licencia"
msgstr "License"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:169
#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/project_detail.html:79
msgid "Instancias"
msgstr "Instances"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:198
msgid "Tareas recientes"
msgstr "Recent tasks"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:214
msgid "Todo lo que necesitas para operar Odoo"
msgstr "Everything you need to run Odoo"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:215
msgid "Del primer despliegue a los backups diarios, sin entrar al servidor."
msgstr ""
"From the first deploy to daily backups, without logging into the server."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:222
msgid "Instancias aisladas"
msgstr "Isolated instances"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:224
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Cada Odoo corre con su propio Postgres, red Docker y volumen de datos. "
"Versiones %(first)s a %(last)s, y una contraseña maestra distinta por "
"instancia."
msgstr ""
"Each Odoo runs with its own Postgres, Docker network and data volume. "
"Versions %(first)s to %(last)s, and a different master password per instance."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:232
msgid "GitHub y módulos"
msgstr "GitHub and modules"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:234
msgid ""
"Conecta un repositorio con tus addons: cada instancia tiene su rama. Sube un "
"módulo en ZIP y se añade al repo y se redespliega."
msgstr ""
"Connect a repository with your addons: each instance gets its own branch. "
"Upload a module as a ZIP and it is added to the repo and redeployed."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:239
msgid "Backups y restauración"
msgstr "Backups and restore"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:241
msgid ""
"Respaldos con base de datos y filestore, manuales o programados con "
"retención. Restaura o crea una instancia nueva a partir de cualquier backup."
msgstr ""
"Backups with database and filestore, manual or scheduled with retention. "
"Restore, or create a new instance from any backup."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:246
msgid "Duplicar para pruebas"
msgstr "Duplicate for testing"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:248
msgid ""
"Clona una instancia con sus datos y adjuntos para tener staging o probar una "
"actualización sin tocar producción."
msgstr ""
"Clone an instance with its data and attachments to get a staging copy or "
"test an upgrade without touching production."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:253
msgid "Dominios y SSL"
msgstr "Domains and SSL"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:255
msgid ""
"Asigna un dominio propio a cada instancia o app. Traefik enruta el tráfico y "
"Let's Encrypt genera los certificados HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"Give each instance or app its own domain. Traefik routes the traffic and "
"Let's Encrypt issues the HTTPS certificates."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:260
msgid "Más que Odoo"
msgstr "More than Odoo"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:262
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(count)s plantillas de apps listas para lanzar junto a tu ERP, o cualquier "
"imagen de Docker como contenedor personalizado."
msgstr ""
"%(count)s app templates ready to launch next to your ERP, or any Docker "
"image as a custom container."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:270
msgid "Seguro por defecto"
msgstr "Secure by default"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:272
msgid ""
"Cada usuario ve solo sus instancias. 2FA opcional u obligatorio, bloqueo por "
"intentos fallidos y registro cerrado salvo que el administrador lo abra."
msgstr ""
"Each user only sees their own instances. Optional or mandatory 2FA, lockout "
"after failed attempts, and sign-up closed unless the admin opens it."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:277
msgid "Tareas en segundo plano"
msgstr "Background tasks"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:279
msgid ""
"Despliegues, backups y restauraciones corren en un worker. El panel responde "
"al instante y te muestra el progreso y el resultado."
msgstr ""
"Deploys, backups and restores run in a worker. The dashboard responds "
"instantly and shows you the progress and the result."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:284
msgid "Consola, logs y métricas"
msgstr "Console, logs and metrics"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:286
msgid ""
"Logs en vivo y consola de cada contenedor, instalación de requirements y "
"métricas de CPU, RAM, disco y Docker del servidor."
msgstr ""
"Live logs and a console for each container, requirements installation, and "
"the server's CPU, RAM, disk and Docker metrics."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:300
msgid "Catálogo"
msgstr "Catalog"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:301
msgid "Apps a un clic"
msgstr "One-click apps"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:303
msgid "Plantillas YAML que puedes ajustar o ampliar en"
msgstr "YAML templates you can tweak or extend in"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:321
msgid "Un servidor, todo en Docker"
msgstr "One server, everything in Docker"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:323
msgid ""
"El panel habla con Docker en tu servidor. No hay servicios externos ni "
"agentes que instalar."
msgstr ""
"The dashboard talks to Docker on your server. No external services or agents "
"to install."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:332
msgid ""
"Recibe el tráfico en los puertos 80/443, aplica el SSL y lo dirige por "
"dominio."
msgstr ""
"Receives traffic on ports 80/443, terminates SSL and routes it by domain."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:340
msgid "Interfaz web y API. Encola las operaciones largas."
msgstr "Web interface and API. Queues long operations."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:346
msgid "Despliega, respalda y restaura. Lanza los backups programados."
msgstr "Deploys, backs up and restores. Runs the scheduled backups."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:356
msgid "Instancia «mi-empresa»"
msgstr "Instance “my-company”"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:357
msgid "Odoo + Postgres en su propia red, filestore en un volumen."
msgstr "Odoo + Postgres on their own network, filestore in a volume."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:364
msgid ""
"La base de datos del panel vive en una red interna a la que las instancias "
"no tienen acceso."
msgstr ""
"The dashboard's database lives on an internal network that instances cannot "
"reach."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:375
msgid "En marcha en minutos"
msgstr "Up and running in minutes"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:381
msgid "Un servidor Linux"
msgstr "A Linux server"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:382
msgid ""
"Con acceso root y los puertos 80 y 443 libres. El instalador se encarga de "
"Docker."
msgstr ""
"With root access and ports 80 and 443 free. The installer takes care of "
"Docker."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:386
msgid "Configura el DNS antes"
msgstr "Set up DNS first"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:387
msgid ""
"Crea un registro A de tu dominio apuntando a la IP del servidor. El "
"instalador te pedirá ese dominio para generar los certificados SSL, y solo "
"funcionan si ya apunta al servidor."
msgstr ""
"Create an A record for your domain pointing to the server's IP. The "
"installer asks for that domain to issue the SSL certificates, which only "
"works if it already points to the server."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:391
msgid "Ejecuta el instalador"
msgstr "Run the installer"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:392
msgid "Genera las claves, configura tu dominio y levanta todos los servicios."
msgstr "It generates the keys, sets up your domain and starts every service."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:396
msgid "Crea tu primera instancia"
msgstr "Create your first instance"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:397
msgid ""
"La primera cuenta que se registra es la de administrador. Elige versión de "
"Odoo y despliega."
msgstr ""
"The first account to sign up becomes the administrator. Pick an Odoo version "
"and deploy."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:403
msgid ""
"Antes de ejecutarlo, comprueba que tu dominio ya apunta al servidor (por "
"ejemplo con «dig +short tudominio.com»). El instalador lo verifica y te "
"avisa si no es así."
msgstr ""
"Before running it, check that your domain already points to the server (e.g. "
"with “dig +short yourdomain.com”). The installer checks it and warns you if "
"it does not."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:408
msgid "Instalación rápida"
msgstr "Quick install"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:411
